### 연결 정보 등록
POST http://localhost:8080/api/connections
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "회사 PostgreSQL",
  "dbType": "POSTGRESQL",
  "host": "localhost",
  "port": 5432,
  "databaseName": "sampledb",
  "username": "dev",
  "password": "dev1234"
}

### 전체 목록 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/connections

### 연결 테스트
POST http://localhost:8080/api/connections/test
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dbType": "POSTGRESQL",
  "host": "localhost",
  "port": 5432,
  "databaseName": "sampledb",
  "username": "dev",
  "password": "dev1234"
}